## 2. Commercial Use (Paid License Required)

**ANY commercial or revenue-generating use of Cinema4K™ shaders is STRICTLY PROHIBITED without an express written Commercial License Agreement and payment of licensing fees.**

Restricted commercial activities include, but are not limited to:
* Integrating, bundling, or embedding Cinema4K™ shaders into any paid, freemium, subscription-based, or ad-supported media player, software application, mobile app, or plugin.
* Using Cinema4K™ shaders in commercial video streaming platforms (OTT/VOD), broadcasting pipelines, or cloud video rendering services.
* Distributing Cinema4K™ shaders as part of commercial hardware devices (set-top boxes, TVs, media centers, graphics cards).
* Sublicensing, re-branding, or selling Cinema4K™ shaders as proprietary software.

